<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><fdroid><repo icon="icon.png" name="FPN Tunnel — AlienBoy69's repo" pubkey="" timestamp="1794484141" url="https://alienboy69.github.io/fdroid-repo/repo" version="20002"><description>FPN Tunnel releases signed by the developer. Add this repo to your F-Droid client to install and auto-update FPN Tunnel.</description></repo><application id="com.fpn.tunnel"><id>com.fpn.tunnel</id><added>2026-11-12</added><lastupdated>2026-11-12</lastupdated><name>FPN Tunnel</name><summary>Whole-phone tunnel for your Mozilla VPN / Firefox Private Network plan</summary><icon>com.fpn.tunnel.22.png</icon><desc>FPN Tunnel is an unofficial, open-source client that turns a Mozilla VPN /
Firefox Private Network subscription into a whole-device Android tunnel.

Sign in with your own Firefox account inside the app, pick an exit country
(or let Auto race them and pick a healthy one), and the whole phone routes
through Mozilla's MASQUE proxies. Built-in connection diagnostics (&quot;Doctor&quot;)
detect sick gateways and fail over across countries automatically.

* No root, no Termux, no companion app — a single APK
* Native in-app Firefox account sign-in (no browser needed)
* Multiple Mozilla accounts with one-tap switching
* Tuned for filtered networks: DNS-over-HTTPS bootstrap, CONNECT-health
  probing, cross-country failover
* No ads, no analytics, no third-party trackers; anonymous error reporting
  is off unless you opt in

A small number of exit countries currently work without a subscription;
the full country set requires a paid Mozilla VPN / Firefox Private Network
subscription. Not affiliated with Mozilla.

Note: builds from this repo are signed with the developer's key — the same
key as the GitHub release APKs, so updates work across both. They are NOT
interchangeable with the future official F-Droid build (signed by F-Droid).</desc><license>MIT</license><categories>Internet</categories><category>Internet</category><web>https://github.com/AlienBoy69/fpn-tunnel-android</web><source>https://github.com/AlienBoy69/fpn-tunnel-android</source><tracker>https://github.com/AlienBoy69/fpn-tunnel-android/issues</tracker><changelog>https://github.com/AlienBoy69/fpn-tunnel-android/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md</changelog><author>AlienBoy69</author><marketversion>4.4.0</marketversion><marketvercode>21</marketvercode><antifeatures>NonFreeNet</antifeatures><package><version>4.4.1</version><versioncode>22</versioncode><apkname>FpnTunnel-v4.4.1.apk</apkname><hash type="sha256">2903b9214094da39f3b2917c4b885d4b0e293ad77b8cdff6289883136087c6a2</hash><size>1137992</size><sdkver>25</sdkver><targetSdkVersion>34</targetSdkVersion><added>2026-11-12</added><sig>a9f118d1e17caa1a39e2f6374e07586d</sig><permissions>FOREGROUND_SERVICE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE_SPECIAL_USE,INTERNET,RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED,REQUEST_INSTALL_PACKAGES,USE_BIOMETRIC</permissions><nativecode>arm64-v8a,armeabi-v7a</nativecode></package><package><version>4.4.0</version><versioncode>21</versioncode><apkname>FpnTunnel-v4.4.0.apk</apkname><hash type="sha256">4edbacb34535093e07273571bccc2460671a2f1287e8ecb019242b3aededc17b</hash><size>1527476</size><sdkver>25</sdkver><targetSdkVersion>34</targetSdkVersion><added>2026-11-12</added><sig>a9f118d1e17caa1a39e2f6374e07586d</sig><permissions>FOREGROUND_SERVICE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE_SPECIAL_USE,INTERNET,RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED,REQUEST_INSTALL_PACKAGES,USE_BIOMETRIC</permissions><nativecode>arm64-v8a,armeabi-v7a</nativecode></package><package><version>4.3.1</version><versioncode>20</versioncode><apkname>FpnTunnel-v4.3.1.apk</apkname><hash type="sha256">021fce9e9d1782925dbdf6af5602915dea1e5480aa2048bb2c3fcff599f1f172</hash><size>972230</size><sdkver>25</sdkver><targetSdkVersion>34</targetSdkVersion><added>2026-11-12</added><sig>a9f118d1e17caa1a39e2f6374e